  "description": "High-performance columnar DataFrame and tabular data processing library, natively implemented in the TokenVector language (tkv) and compiled to a .NET CIL DLL: schema, columns, series, vector math, filter, group-by, joins (incl. AsOf), pivot/melt, CSV/JSON IO, Arrow IPC stream and out-of-core batches, SQL SELECT engine, SpreadsheetML Excel IO, zero-copy Mat bridge for numerics.",
