  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.8-dev: SQL/Excel/Parquet-ledger (tvsrc v2.1). tokenvector_sql: SELECT engine on DataFrame - sql_query/sql_query2/sql_count (WHERE/GROUP BY/HAVING/ORDER BY/LIMIT/OFFSET/DISTINCT, INNER/LEFT/RIGHT JOIN, IN/LIKE, 10 aggregates, verified number-for-number vs pandas). tokenvector_excel: SpreadsheetML 2003 read/write (pure XML, Excel opens directly). tokenvector_parquet: honest ledger - API reserved but fail-fast (real Parquet needs compiler binary write + bitwise R5). sql_check 37/37, excel_check 33/33, 20/20 suites green on DIST tkvc, DLL smoke 54/54 symbols + functional C# calls.",
  "title": "TokenVector.Data - High-Performance Columnar DataFrame & Tabular Engine (TokenVector Language)",
